@@ -12,6 +12,13 @@ See the [Contributing Guide](contributing.md) for details.
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Changed
+
+* Footnotes are now numbered and listed in the order they are first referenced
+  in the document rather than the order they are defined. A new
+  `USE_DEFINITION_ORDER` option restores the previous behavior (see the
+  "Footnotes numbering" issue).
+
 ### Fixed
 
 * Fix handling of incomplete HTML tags in code spans in Python 3.14.
